# WhisperMe sxhkd configuration example
# Copy to ~/.config/sxhkd/sxhkdrc and reload sxhkd with: pkill -USR1 sxhkd
#
# See HOTKEY_SETUP.md for more configuration options

# Hold Super+Shift+Space to record, release to stop
super + shift + space
    whisperme start

@super + shift + space
    whisperme stop

# Alternative: Toggle mode (press once to start, again to stop)
# super + alt + space
#     whisperme toggle
